  "description": "A gambler died, leaving behind a large inheritance. Then, an invitation to a game where the inheritance is at stake is sent to 10 people who are connected... \n\nThe participants wander with their own calculations and schemes in a situation where they cannot see the future. In the meantime, a storyteller smiles alone. Who will obtain the inheritance after a life-or-death gamble where reason and madness intersect? \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
